00:12:26.217 --> 00:12:28.852
Homer. this is the most sacred spot

258
00:12:28.919 --> 00:12:31.554
In christendom.
not your backyard hammock!

259
00:12:31.622 --> 00:12:33.022
I'm sorry.

260
00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:35.525
It's just that these
tours are so exhausting.

261
00:12:35.593 --> 00:12:37.894
You're jet-lagged.
You're walking around all day.

262
00:12:37.962 --> 00:12:41.030
It's so hard to sleep
knowing marge and the kids

263
00:12:41.098 --> 00:12:43.266
Are all stuck in one
small room. and...

264
00:12:43.334 --> 00:12:45.134
It's so nice and cool

265
00:12:45.202 --> 00:12:47.837
