not even a real pig!

270
00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:59.349
<i>But he is buried here. right?</i>

271
00:12:59.416 --> 00:13:01.584
That's it! I'm losing it!

272
00:13:01.652 --> 00:13:03.720
I'm losing it! You come all the way

273
00:13:03.787 --> 00:13:05.688
To jerusalem.
the happiest place on earth.

274
00:13:05.756 --> 00:13:08.925
And all the photos in your
camera are of funny soda pops?!

275
00:13:09.894 --> 00:13:11.027
Oh. will you...

276
00:13:11.095 --> 00:13:12.262
You are such a...

277
