Ah!

278
00:13:13.664 --> 00:13:16.065
Chickpea fizz!

279
00:13:16.133 --> 00:13:18.268
Delete. Delete. Delete.

280
00:13:18.335 --> 00:13:19.769
<i>Whatever. It's your camera.</i>

281
00:13:27.978 --> 00:13:29.879
Please. you've got
to let me back in.

282
00:13:29.947 --> 00:13:32.348
