this church again.

286
00:13:37.588 --> 00:13:39.756
B-banned for life?

287
00:13:39.823 --> 00:13:42.292
Homer. do you know
why I'm a christian?

288
00:13:42.359 --> 00:13:43.760
Your parents made you?

289
00:13:43.827 --> 00:13:46.195
It's because I believe every soul

290
00:13:46.263 --> 00:13:48.331
Has the possibility of salvation.

291
00:13:48.399 --> 00:13:50.867
At least I thought so till now.

292
00:13:50.935 --> 00:13:54.837
Homer simpson.
you are not worth saving.

293
00:13:54.905 --> 00:13:58.341
What? But I thought we'd
be neighbors in heaven.

294
00:13:58.409 --> 00:14:00.476
Goofing on all the new
dead people. Not...

295
00:14:00.544 --> 00:14:02.912
