contemplate the torah.

309
00:15:05.809 --> 00:15:09.245
<i> </i>

310
00:15:09.313 --> 00:15:11.147
Flanders!

311
00:15:11.215 --> 00:15:13.583
Stupid flanders!

312
00:15:18.789 --> 00:15:22.225
Oh! There's sand in my shoe. too!

313
00:15:22.292 --> 00:15:24.594
Oh! Oh...!

314
00:15:24.662 --> 00:15:25.828
Oh.

315
00:15:28.599 --> 00:15:31.968
Good luck surviving without me!

316
00:15:32.036 --> 00:15:34.404
<i> ¶ thirsty ¶</i>

317
00:15:34.471 --> 00:15:37.507
¶ I am so thirsty ¶

318
