¶ but mostly just thirsty ¶

320
00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:49.252
¶ I am so thirsty ¶

321
00:15:49.319 --> 00:15:51.020
Huh?

322
00:15:51.088 --> 00:15:52.488
Water!

323
00:15:55.125 --> 00:15:56.959
Oh! So salty!

324
