Maybe if I add a little salt.

325
00:16:28.726 --> 00:16:30.727
You have been chosen. homer.

326
00:16:30.794 --> 00:16:33.296
Chosen for what. o mighty gherkin?

327
00:16:33.363 --> 00:16:36.199
Rise and listen. my child.

328
00:16:36.266 --> 00:16:39.635
Yours is a great destiny.

329
00:16:39.703 --> 00:16:41.637
Pickle. carrot. tomato. pickle.

330
00:16:41.705 --> 00:16:43.039
Carrot. tomato. pickle. carrot.

331
00:16:43.107 --> 00:16:44.540
Tomato. pickle. carrot. tomato...

332
00:16:46.777 --> 00:16:49.679
Oh. homie. you're alive!

333
00:16:49.747 --> 00:16:52.648
I am more than alive. woman.

334
00:16:52.716 --> 00:16:54.751
I am the chosen one

335
00:16:54.818 --> 00:16:57.820
Who shall unite all the
faiths of the holy land!

336
00:16:57.888 --> 00:17:01.023
I am... The messiah!

337
00:17:01.091 --> 00:17:03.226
But you still have
our passports. right?

338
00:17:03.293 --> 00:17:04.727
Oh. yeah.

339
00:17:04.795 --> 00:17:06.996
Got to keep track of those.

340
00:17:07.064 --> 00:17:08.998
The messiah...

341
00:17:09.066 --> 00:17:10.833
Has the passports.

342
00:17:13.404 --> 00:17:16.906
Dad. are you okay?
I am more than okay!

343
00:17:16.974 --> 00:17:19.742
I am the messiah.
come to save the world!

344
00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.577
Look upon me and shudder!

345
