I already do that.

346
00:17:22.846 --> 00:17:24.781
Uh... Messiah?

347
00:17:24.848 --> 00:17:27.817
Do you mind if I have a word
with your wife? As you wish.

348
00:17:27.885 --> 00:17:29.752
But look not upon her with lust.

349
00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.687
And do not send her
friendly e-mails.

350
00:17:31.755 --> 00:17:33.322
That's how it begins.

351
00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:37.827
Homer is suffering
from what's called

352
00:17:37.895 --> 00:17:39.429
