353
00:17:39.496 --> 00:17:41.664
Ah. yes. jerusalem syndrome:

354
00:17:41.732 --> 00:17:43.966
The name given to religious
delusions or psychoses

355
00:17:44.034 --> 00:17:46.069
That occur when people
visit jerusalem.

356
00:17:46.136 --> 00:17:49.172
Have you ever noticed that
dad always gets the disease

357
00:17:49.239 --> 00:17:51.274
They write about in the
in-flight magazine?

358
00:17:51.341 --> 00:17:52.608
Oh. my god!

359
